<title>USA: Opta Food names Scott Kumf finance chief.</title>
<headline>Opta Food names Scott Kumf finance chief.</headline>
<dateline>BEDFORD, Mass. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Opta Food Ingredients Inc said on Wednesday it named Scott Kumf as chief financial officer, and vice president of administration and has been named a director.</p>
<p>Kumf most recently served as chief financial officer of Boston Coach Corp, a unit of Fidelity Investments, the company said.</p>
<p>Thomas Trometer, who has been the company's most senior financial executive, will continue with the company as vice president of finance, Opta Food said.</p>
</text>
